        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><div class=\"page-kicker\">第1問・解答解説</div><h2>第1問 解答・解説</h2><section class=\"answer-key-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-01-answer-key\"><h3 id=\"major-question-01-answer-key\">解答</h3><dl class=\"answer-key\"><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問1</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ア: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ア</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"イ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">イ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ウ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ウ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"エ: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">エ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"オ: 8\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">オ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">8</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"カ: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">カ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"キ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">キ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ク: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ク</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ケ: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ケ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"コ: 8\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">コ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">8</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問2</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"サ: 0\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">サ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">0</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"シ: 0\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">シ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">0</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問3</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ス: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ス</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"セ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">セ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ソ: 0\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ソ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">0</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問4</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"タ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">タ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"チ: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">チ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ツ: 8\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ツ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">8</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"テ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">テ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ト: 6\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ト</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">6</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ナ: 8\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ナ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">8</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ニ: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ニ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ヌ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ヌ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ネ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ネ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span></dd></div></dl></section><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-01-section-01\"><h3 id=\"major-question-01-section-01\">問1　極大値・極小値</h3><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>最初に確認</strong><p>分母が0になる <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=\\pm\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}</span> では関数が定義されません。増減を考えるときは、この2点で区間を分けます。</p></aside><p class=\"prose\">商の微分公式で <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(x)=\\frac{x^3}{2x^2-1}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(x)=\\frac{x^3}{2x^2-1}</span> を微分します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"f&#39;(x)=\\frac{3x^2(2x^2-1)-4x^4}{(2x^2-1)^2}=\\frac{x^2(2x^2-3)}{(2x^2-1)^2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f&#39;(x)=\\frac{3x^2(2x^2-1)-4x^4}{(2x^2-1)^2}=\\frac{x^2(2x^2-3)}{(2x^2-1)^2}</div><p class=\"prose\">分母は定義域内で正、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x^2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x^2</span> も負にはなりません。したがって符号を決めるのは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2x^2-3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">2x^2-3</span> です。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}</span> では増加から減少へ、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}</span> では減少から増加へ変わります。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=0</span> では符号が変わらないため極値ではありません。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"f\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\\right)=-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8},\\qquad f\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\\right)=\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\\right)=-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8},\\qquad f\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}\\right)=\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>極大値は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span>、極小値は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-01-section-02\"><h3 id=\"major-question-01-section-02\">問2　変曲点</h3><p class=\"prose\">2階微分を求め、凹凸が切り替わる点を調べます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"f&#39;&#39;(x)=\\frac{2x(2x^2+3)}{(2x^2-1)^3}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f&#39;&#39;(x)=\\frac{2x(2x^2+3)}{(2x^2-1)^3}</div><p class=\"prose\">定義域内で <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f&#39;&#39;(x)=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f&#39;&#39;(x)=0</span> となるのは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=0</span> だけで、その前後で符号が変化します。また <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(0)=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f(0)=0</span> です。</p><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>変曲点は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(0,0)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(0,0)</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-01-section-03\"><h3 id=\"major-question-01-section-03\">問3　斜めの漸近線</h3><p class=\"prose\">分子を分母で割ると、直線部分と0へ近づく部分に分けられます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"f(x)=\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{x}{2(2x^2-1)}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">f(x)=\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{x}{2(2x^2-1)}</div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(f(x)-\\frac{x}{2}\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{x}{2(2x^2-1)}=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\left(f(x)-\\frac{x}{2}\\right)=\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{x}{2(2x^2-1)}=0</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"a=\\frac12,\\ b=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">a=\\frac12,\\ b=0</span> で、漸近線は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=\\frac12x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=\\frac12x</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-01-section-04\"><h3 id=\"major-question-01-section-04\">問4　異なる実数解の個数</h3><p class=\"prose\">方程式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x^3-2kx^2+k=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x^3-2kx^2+k=0</span> の判別式を使います。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\Delta=k^2(32k^2-27)\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\Delta=k^2(32k^2-27)</div><p class=\"prose\">境界は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"32k^2-27=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">32k^2-27=0</span>、すなわち <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k=\\pm\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">k=\\pm\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span> です。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">k=0</span> のときは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x^3=0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x^3=0</span> なので、異なる実数解は1個です。</p><div class=\"table-scroll answer-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"source-table answer-table\"><caption>kの範囲と異なる実数解の個数</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">kの条件</th><th scope=\"col\">個数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}&lt;k&lt;\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}&lt;k&lt;\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span></td><td>1個</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k=\\pm\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">k=\\pm\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span></td><td>2個</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k&lt;-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">k&lt;-\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span> または <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k&gt;\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">k&gt;\\frac{3\\sqrt6}{8}</span></td><td>3個</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>中央の範囲で1個、境界で2個、外側で3個です。</span></p></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "第2問",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><div class=\"page-kicker\">第2問・解答解説</div><h2>第2問 解答・解説</h2><section class=\"answer-key-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-02-answer-key\"><h3 id=\"major-question-02-answer-key\">解答</h3><dl class=\"answer-key\"><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問1</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ア: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ア</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"イ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">イ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ウ: 0\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ウ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">0</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"エ: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">エ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問2</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"オ: 7\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">オ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">7</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"カ: 7\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">カ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">7</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問3</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"キ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">キ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ク: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ク</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ケ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ケ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問4</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"コサ: 28\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">コサ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">28</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"シ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">シ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ス: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ス</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"セ: 7\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">セ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">7</span></span></dd></div></dl></section><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-02-section-01\"><h3 id=\"major-question-02-section-01\">問1　角Aと辺CA</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"CA=x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">CA=x</span> とおきます。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BC=\\sqrt7&gt;AB=2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BC=\\sqrt7&gt;AB=2</span> なので <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"A&gt;C\" data-display-mode=\"false\">A&gt;C</span> です。もし角Cが鈍角なら角Aも鈍角となって三角形に矛盾するため、角Cは鋭角です。したがって、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sin C=\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}7\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\sin C=\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}7</span> から <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\cos C=\\frac2{\\sqrt7}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\cos C=\\frac2{\\sqrt7}</span> です。角Cに余弦定理を使います。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"2^2=x^2+(\\sqrt7)^2-2x\\sqrt7\\cdot\\frac2{\\sqrt7}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">2^2=x^2+(\\sqrt7)^2-2x\\sqrt7\\cdot\\frac2{\\sqrt7}</div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"x^2-4x+3=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=1,3\" data-display-mode=\"true\">x^2-4x+3=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x=1,3</div><p class=\"prose\">条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt7&gt;x\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\sqrt7&gt;x</span> を満たすのは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=1</span> です。3辺が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AB=2, AC=1, BC=\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AB=2, AC=1, BC=\\sqrt7</span> と分かったので、今度は角Aに余弦定理を使います。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\cos A=\\frac{2^2+1^2-(\\sqrt7)^2}{2\\cdot2\\cdot1}=-\\frac12\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\cos A=\\frac{2^2+1^2-(\\sqrt7)^2}{2\\cdot2\\cdot1}=-\\frac12</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\angle BAC=120^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\angle BAC=120^\\circ</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"CA=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">CA=1</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-02-section-02\"><h3 id=\"major-question-02-section-02\">問2　BEとCE</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BD:DC=2:1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BD:DC=2:1</span> であり、問1から <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AB:AC=2:1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AB:AC=2:1</span> です。角の二等分線定理の逆より、直線AEは角Aを二等分します。円周角が等しいため、対応する弦も等しく <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BE=CE\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BE=CE</span> です。</p><p class=\"prose\">円に内接する四角形ABECでは、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\angle BEC=180^\\circ-\\angle BAC=60^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\angle BEC=180^\\circ-\\angle BAC=60^\\circ</span> です。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BE=CE=y\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BE=CE=y</span> として三角形BECに余弦定理を使います。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"7=y^2+y^2-2y^2\\cos60^\\circ=y^2\" data-display-mode=\"true\">7=y^2+y^2-2y^2\\cos60^\\circ=y^2</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"BE=CE=\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"false\">BE=CE=\\sqrt7</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-02-section-03\"><h3 id=\"major-question-02-section-03\">問3　ADとAE</h3><p class=\"prose\">DはBCを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2:1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">2:1</span> に内分するので、Aを始点とする位置ベクトルで表します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{AD}=\\frac13\\overrightarrow{AB}+\\frac23\\overrightarrow{AC}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\overrightarrow{AD}=\\frac13\\overrightarrow{AB}+\\frac23\\overrightarrow{AC}</div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\overrightarrow{AB}|^2=4\" data-display-mode=\"false\">|\\overrightarrow{AB}|^2=4</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"|\\overrightarrow{AC}|^2=1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">|\\overrightarrow{AC}|^2=1</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=2\\cos120^\\circ=-1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=2\\cos120^\\circ=-1</span> を代入します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"AD^2=\\frac19\\cdot4+\\frac49\\cdot1+2\\cdot\\frac13\\cdot\\frac23\\cdot(-1)=\\frac49\" data-display-mode=\"true\">AD^2=\\frac19\\cdot4+\\frac49\\cdot1+2\\cdot\\frac13\\cdot\\frac23\\cdot(-1)=\\frac49</div><p class=\"prose\">よって <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AD=\\frac23\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AD=\\frac23</span> です。点Dで2本の弦AEとBCが交わるので、方べきの定理を使います。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac23\\left(AE-\\frac23\\right)=\\frac{2\\sqrt7}{3}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt7}{3}=\\frac{14}{9}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac23\\left(AE-\\frac23\\right)=\\frac{2\\sqrt7}{3}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt7}{3}=\\frac{14}{9}</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AD=\\frac23\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AD=\\frac23</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"AE=3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">AE=3</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-02-section-04\"><h3 id=\"major-question-02-section-04\">問4　内心と外心の距離</h3><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>計算を短くする方針</strong><p>三角形の外接円半径をR、内接円半径をrとし、オイラーの公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"OI^2=R(R-2r)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">OI^2=R(R-2r)</span> を使います。</p></aside><p class=\"prose\">三角形ABCの面積をS、半周長をsとすると、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"S=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">S=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"s=\\frac{3+\\sqrt7}{2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">s=\\frac{3+\\sqrt7}{2}</span> です。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"R=\\frac{AB\\cdot AC\\cdot BC}{4S}=\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}3,\\qquad r=\\frac{S}{s}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3+\\sqrt7}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">R=\\frac{AB\\cdot AC\\cdot BC}{4S}=\\frac{\\sqrt{21}}3,\\qquad r=\\frac{S}{s}=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{3+\\sqrt7}</div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"OI^2=R^2-2Rr=\\frac73-(3\\sqrt7-7)=\\frac{28}{3}-3\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"true\">OI^2=R^2-2Rr=\\frac73-(3\\sqrt7-7)=\\frac{28}{3}-3\\sqrt7</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"OI^2=\\frac{28}{3}-3\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"false\">OI^2=\\frac{28}{3}-3\\sqrt7</span> です。</span></p></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
