        "order": 3,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><div class=\"page-kicker\">第3問・解答解説</div><h2>第3問 解答・解説</h2><section class=\"answer-key-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-answer-key\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-answer-key\">解答</h3><dl class=\"answer-key\"><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問1</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ア: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ア</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"イ: 8\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">イ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">8</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ウ: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ウ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"エオ: 28\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">エオ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">28</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問2</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"カ: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">カ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"キ: 7\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">キ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">7</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問3</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ク: 3\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ク</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">3</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"ケコ: 28\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">ケコ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">28</span></span></dd></div><div class=\"answer-key__question\"><dt class=\"answer-key__question-label\">問4</dt><dd class=\"answer-key__slots\"><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"サ: 1\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">サ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">1</span></span><span class=\"answer-key__slot\" aria-label=\"シ: 2\"><span class=\"answer-key__mark\">シ</span><span class=\"answer-key__value\">2</span></span></dd></div></dl></section><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-section-01\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-section-01\">準備　全事象</h3><p class=\"prose\">8枚はすべて異なり、4枚を選んで順番に並べます。したがって全事象は次の1680通りです。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"{}_8P_4=8\\cdot7\\cdot6\\cdot5=1680\" data-display-mode=\"true\">{}_8P_4=8\\cdot7\\cdot6\\cdot5=1680</div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-section-02\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-section-02\">問1　位置を固定して数える</h3><p class=\"prose\">1を左から2番目に固定すると、残り3か所は残る7枚から選んで並べるため <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_7P_3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_7P_3</span> 通りです。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{{}_7P_3}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac18\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{{}_7P_3}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac18</div><p class=\"prose\">1と8を両端に置く順序は2通り、中央2か所には残る6枚から2枚を並べます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac1{28}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac1{28}</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>確率は順に <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac18\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac18</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac1{28}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac1{28}</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-section-03\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-section-03\">問2　両端の偶奇が同じ</h3><p class=\"prose\">偶数は4枚、奇数も4枚です。両端を偶数にする並べ方は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_4P_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_4P_2</span> 通りで、中央は残る6枚から2枚を並べるので <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_6P_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_6P_2</span> 通りです。両端が奇数の場合も同数です。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{2\\cdot{}_4P_2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac37\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{2\\cdot{}_4P_2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac37</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>求める確率は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac37\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac37</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-section-04\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-section-04\">問3　1と8を一つのブロックにする</h3><p class=\"prose\">1と8のブロックを置ける位置は3か所、ブロック内の順序は2通りです。残り2か所へは残る6枚から2枚を並べます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{3\\cdot2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac3{28}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{3\\cdot2\\cdot{}_6P_2}{{}_8P_4}=\\frac3{28}</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>求める確率は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac3{28}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac3{28}</span> です。</span></p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\" aria-labelledby=\"major-question-03-section-05\"><h3 id=\"major-question-03-section-05\">問4　偶数が連続しない並べ方</h3><p class=\"prose\">偶数の使用枚数で分けます。偶数2枚なら、4か所から隣り合わない2か所を選ぶ方法が3通りあります。偶数1枚なら位置は4通り、偶数0枚なら奇数4枚を並べるだけです。</p><div class=\"table-scroll answer-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"source-table answer-table\"><caption>条件を満たす並べ方</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">偶数の枚数</th><th scope=\"col\">位置の選び方</th><th scope=\"col\">カードの並べ方</th><th scope=\"col\">小計</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>2枚</td><td>3通り</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_4P_2\\cdot{}_4P_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_4P_2\\cdot{}_4P_2</span></td><td>432通り</td></tr><tr><td>1枚</td><td>4通り</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_4P_1\\cdot{}_4P_3\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_4P_1\\cdot{}_4P_3</span></td><td>384通り</td></tr><tr><td>0枚</td><td>1通り</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}_4P_4\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}_4P_4</span></td><td>24通り</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-katex=\"\\frac{432+384+24}{1680}=\\frac{840}{1680}=\\frac12\" data-display-mode=\"true\">\\frac{432+384+24}{1680}=\\frac{840}{1680}=\\frac12</div><p class=\"answer-result\"><strong>結論</strong><span>求める確率は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac12\" data-display-mode=\"false\">\\frac12</span> です。</span></p></section></div></article>"
